<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NORTHERNS ON THE RACK AGAINST EP AT 77-7.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NORTHERNS ON THE RACK AGAINST EP AT 77-7.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Transvaal, chasing a target of 322, collapsed to 77 for seven at lunch in the Supersport cricket match against Eastern Province at St George's Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Eastern Province first innings 432-9 declared</p>
<p>Northerns first innings 272 </p>
<p>Eastern Province second innings 161-2 declared</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal second innings 77-7</p>
</text>
